+        // Lifting maps leaf block j onto block j of every column, so each block is committed on
+        // its own with block-local states; every column block must fill at least one packed row.
+        // Each block's leaves are whole subtrees, so the skipped layers are built per block.
+        if sorted_coeffs.is_empty()
+            || sorted_coeffs[0].log_size() < LOG_N_LANES
